{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的短行较多，部分段落需要上下反复扫视，X左栏的连续叙述读起来更顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段最重要的心理支点，让观众即使不逐字阅读，也能迅速抓住人物当下的处境和念头。它还把离开后的失落、对亲近关系的怀念、对孤独的恐惧、反复动摇，直到不再逼自己选边而继续向前，串成了清楚的心理发展过程。尤其是感受描述，Y更贴近具体的音色、节奏、旋律变化和出现时机，既有细腻的情绪层次，也更容易让观众在听音乐时感受到这些变化，而不是只看到一堆情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf487ffc-17d4-45da-819f-ccf037954d68", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T213808307032Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.11, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:38:49.415205+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "205426a1c03af1b948b908a1d2f87ad4c9dfb59726c701f7109ca4fed68eecd0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p